# Rendered by paisans. Do not edit: `paisans deployment apply` overwrites this file.
#
# Routing for notify, imported by the gateway's block for
# notify.example.org. The service serves GET /healthz alone, answering ok while
# its state file is readable, so the monitor's public check sees it through
# the gateway. Nothing else is proxied.
@health expression `method('GET') && path('/healthz')`
handle @health {
	reverse_proxy 10.44.0.3:8085 {
	}
}
handle {
	respond 404
}
